{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-02/1060533/block/singleImage/3249786/df/01KJ0748ZY1TRNBH427CC6RAXN.png?updatedAt=1793086038\"/><figcaption>六合彩萬聖節金多寶周六晚攪珠，估計頭獎基金為8,000萬元。(資料圖片/中通社)</figcaption></figure><p>六合彩萬聖節金多寶周六（31日）晚攪珠，特設6,000萬元金多寶，若以10元一注獨中，估計頭獎基金為8,000萬元。 4、22及29號攪出次數最多 馬會指，歷年舉行過10次萬聖節金多寶攪珠，當中，「4」號、「22」號及「29」號開出了4次，是被攪出次數最多的號碼，亦有「17」號、「20」號及「28」號、「34」號及「35」號，亦攪出過3次。 馬會提及，為預留更多時間讓顧客購買彩票，原定於10月29日的攪珠將不會舉行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:14.924371+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:27:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T20:18:28.980633+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:28.156154+00:00","content_hash":"313da94f24f8ee56430111eafa2292138c720708a503eb35d22090322276a344","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:14.924371+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}